_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 84
---
order: 84
---
short_label: X.84
---
statement: To a straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole only one straight line can be annexed which is incommensurable in square with the whole straight line and which with the whole straight line makes the sum of squares on them medial and twice the rectangle contained by them both medial and also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them.
---
proof:

